invalid type: string "## Core Values\n\nNexora officially defines five core values:\n\n1. Build with Intent\n2. Own the Outcome\n3. Learn in Public\n4. Respect the Clock\n5. Leave Systems Better\n\nThe phrase \"Leave Systems Better\" refers specifically to improving internal\nprocesses, documentation, and engineering systems rather than environmental\nsustainability.\n\n## Internal Communication\n